id           = ATTACK-T1137.003
name         = Outlook Forms
modified     = 2025-10-24T17:49:12.562Z
platforms    = Windows Office Suite
tactics      = persistence
data_sources = 

description : Adversaries may abuse Microsoft Outlook forms to obtain persistence on a compromised system. Outlook forms are used as templates for presentation and functionality in Outlook messages. Custom Outlook forms can be created that will execute code when a specifically crafted email is sent by an adversary utilizing the same custom Outlook form.(Citation: SensePost Outlook Forms) Once malicious forms have been added to the user’s mailbox, they will be loaded when Outlook is started. Malicious forms will execute when an adversary sends a specifically crafted email to the user.(Citation: SensePost Outlook Forms)

notes : https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1137/003/
